Date: Fri, 23 Jan 2026 10:32:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/20] feat: add houmo npu support

- Add Dadao text LLM inference support for Qwen3/Qwen2.5/Qwen2 on houmo
  M50 and M30 NPU.
- Add prompt caching support to improve inference efficiency.
- Enable plugin-based model loading for better flexibility.
- Add support for interruption during the prefill stage to allow
   early termination and improve runtime controllability.(20260224)

Task: #525831

From: kylin

Severity: Critical

